OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry and largely sunny day
OL,6,Ftoday with just a little high cloud
OL,7,Fdeveloping at times during the
OL,8,Fafternoon. Feeling very hot in the
OL,9,Fstrong sunshine and light winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA dry and very warm evening
OL,12,Fwith plenty of late sunshine.
OL,13,FOvernight some high cloud will spill
OL,14,Fin but it will remain warm, leading to
OL,15,Fan uncomfortable night to sleep.
OL,16,
OL,17,CFriday:FAnother largely sunny and dry
OL,18,Fday for most, although a risk of a few
OL,19,Fshowers developing later in the day. A
OL,20,Flittle cooler but still feeling hot.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
