OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FA risk
OL,6,Fof some further showers on Saturday,
OL,7,Fbut many places staying dry. Dry and
OL,8,Fbright on Sunday and Monday, with
OL,9,Fperhaps some rain later Monday.
OL,10,FTemperatures nearer average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
